{
  "work_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks",
  "source_path": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    },
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-14",
      "script": "__main__"
    },
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-15": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-15",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0000",
      "source_sha256": "b33ea46a1b9e5089",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Nineveh will be destroyed. We saw no sign through him, and we turned away from our ways."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0001",
      "source_sha256": "66d9612daaf2fe62",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But God came to you. He performed miracles among you that neither Jonah nor Solomon nor anyone else performed, and you did not repent."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0002",
      "source_sha256": "b0861f4f344712dd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This rebuke that will come upon us is that of people who had despaired of their lives at a time when they did not think they would see anything good."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0003",
      "source_sha256": "907da78d765e0504",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Yet they did see it, and the Lord added this other statement about them: they will rise on the day of judgment and condemn this generation. What, then, will we do before the rebuke of these multitudes of saints,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0004.s1",
      "source_sha256": "ef15712f03d362e5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-15",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "who proclaimed to us the ways of life and the works of salvation, and who also gave their blood for us, like God,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0004.s2",
      "source_sha256": "d4d2b6f2380b78fa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-15",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "who gave his own blood for us—Jesus, to whom all judgment belongs, which is on the lips of those who were promised that they would pass judgment on us, the one who will command those to whom he promised that they would sit"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0004.s3",
      "source_sha256": "b179b71e4f093794",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-15",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "on the thrones and judge the twelve tribes of Israel, and judge every human being who has lived on earth, and judge angels. On what grounds will they judge them?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0005",
      "source_sha256": "040f16fb38cdf47b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They will judge them,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0006",
      "source_sha256": "34c7e502d95fb6b1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "saying, “Instead of helping others escape Satan’s grasp and every evil,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0007",
      "source_sha256": "591a3e749da1dda6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "you rushed all the more into evil, like birds into a trap."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0008",
      "source_sha256": "8cdddd8009b02fed",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When you desired the daughters of men, you committed evil with them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0009",
      "source_sha256": "6d217e1aa6bab268",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You stirred up war on earth instead of peace.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0010",
      "source_sha256": "3d47065e67a1c02c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And they will also pass judgment on us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0011",
      "source_sha256": "5eb235253beb3982",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For what will they pass judgment on us?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0012",
      "source_sha256": "03e8342820a6ae83",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“You did not listen to our words. You did not strive to imitate our deeds. You did not desire our ways.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0013",
      "source_sha256": "1c0e87c0e0aa5bcd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I will say no more about these things."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0014",
      "source_sha256": "34ae3ce6ac4c8296",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "Let this alone suffice for them to say together, from the patriarchs to the prophets and the apostles and all the saints, rebuking our shamelessness:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0015",
      "source_sha256": "5c3c153aba09a0b0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For God came to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0016",
      "source_sha256": "b860ab351ca6f94c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "God was crucified for you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0017",
      "source_sha256": "58554dbfdcfa9b8c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You did not take care to turn away from the deeds of demons."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0018",
      "source_sha256": "ca45e3e98a862771",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It was with one voice that a crowd of people, ready to kill, shouted at the Place of the Skull,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0019",
      "source_sha256": "b203bba33e255f2d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Take him away! Take him away! Crucify him!”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0020",
      "source_sha256": "8d6c9815533fbcdd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Likewise, a single voice will come from his holy judgment seat,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0021",
      "source_sha256": "8b544899eedd5c2e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Take them away! Take them away!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0022",
      "source_sha256": "6b16c01b5e2ad198",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Take away the chaff and the weeds!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0023",
      "source_sha256": "1e72d00462fd3ab8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Take away the bad fish and the goats!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0024",
      "source_sha256": "bb9c6707509085dc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Bind their hands and feet and throw them into the underworld!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0025",
      "source_sha256": "1e579cd345dbe48b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Punish them! Punish them in that place!”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0026.s1",
      "source_sha256": "12c90efd9ae27ffa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-15",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "If those whom blind Beliar had blinded cried out together, “Do not release this man,” and their voices prevailed, then how will they not cry"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0026.s2",
      "source_sha256": "ddfe1cbd5dd42dc4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-15",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "out together—the thousands upon thousands and tens of thousands upon tens of thousands of archangels, and the entire multitude of his chosen ones—“Do not release these people from their eternal punishment”?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0027",
      "source_sha256": "acb80b79674a0f43",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And how much more will their voices prevail!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0028",
      "source_sha256": "8ae87fe1b1934f8e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Do not have mercy on these people who do not believe in you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0029",
      "source_sha256": "69d48f704193bdce",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Do not have compassion on those who did not recognize you as God and the Son of God.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0030",
      "source_sha256": "a1d96aff18e4ff30",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But how did they arrest him?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0031",
      "source_sha256": "519b5561e7a8d073",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Was it with hostility, rushing at him in all their anger, with their swords and clubs, dragging him before a governor like a thief?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0032",
      "source_sha256": "81f88cfb4c5a0e4f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or did they instead lead him along, inviting him with kindness and peace to take him to a dinner?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0033",
      "source_sha256": "2373036c6e70b2ff",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And how will those who die without believing in him find rest?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0034",
      "source_sha256": "e54f3aae9df41e2d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or where will they escape the fury and wrath of all his angels, who will begin from the four corners of the whole earth on the day when he sends them to gather all the nations before his judgment seat?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0035",
      "source_sha256": "34c6bda73a80fc47",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Certainly, too, they took him out to destroy him savagely."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0036",
      "source_sha256": "ce059092fda57035",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It is impossible for wisdom or gentleness to arise from wickedness or envy."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0037",
      "source_sha256": "c106b3c82d81c296",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "How, then, will they refrain from destroying the soul and body of those who deny that Jesus is the Christ?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0038",
      "source_sha256": "b8592b87891e0d08",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He was patient on the cross while they spoke these wicked things against him, opening their mouths against him and raising their voices against him like lions and calves, with laughter and loud shouting,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0039",
      "source_sha256": "407b0d89c57d2707",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that we might now hear the words of the Gospels being read to us in a voice of peace, humility, and kindness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0040",
      "source_sha256": "a640021e65dd7f04",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Though they did all these things to him, he was not disturbed."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0041",
      "source_sha256": "15205f81f2793b29",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But they were not merely disturbed;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0042",
      "source_sha256": "62ac2c500e457ea6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "they were falling backward, striking their noses against the ground."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0043",
      "source_sha256": "c9f6ce979474fbed",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And they were fighting, threatening, and striking him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0044",
      "source_sha256": "1cbf115b46e098a3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But he did not reveal his divinity in its fullness, lest he destroy the earth in his anger from that very day because of those who were doing evil to him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0045.s1",
      "source_sha256": "6dae6f8f92770f5e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-15",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "How will his kingdom be filled even more with good and righteous people and sinless multitudes,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0045.s2",
      "source_sha256": "3329c59072352f3a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-15",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "and sinners who have all repented through the preaching of the gospel?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0046.s1",
      "source_sha256": "329867cad72b6599",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-15",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "Yet amid the hostility and hatred of the scribes, the Pharisees, the chief priests, the elders, and all the people there, which they directed against him,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0046.s2",
      "source_sha256": "a13a21f254554edd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-15",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "the love and all the peace of his church and all his congregations increased."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0047",
      "source_sha256": "a0e682507856de92",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he will again increase his peace upon us; he will again add to his love for us, and we too will add to our love for one another."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0048.s1",
      "source_sha256": "57ded67994ba0070",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-15",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "Anyone who does not pay attention to these words so as to renounce the devil and keep sin away from his soul, lest it destroy his soul like a boar"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0048.s2",
      "source_sha256": "cefe9c7183dbf0de",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-15",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "and he go mad like a male donkey, is unaware that wisdom has an advantage"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0048.s3",
      "source_sha256": "4496165603303aba",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-15",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "over foolishness, just as light has an advantage over darkness, as Ecclesiastes said."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0049",
      "source_sha256": "d8a5210eacabdac7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Anyone who does not accept these words does not understand that what the eyes see is better than wandering with one's soul."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0050",
      "source_sha256": "ea2bc403c5b337a8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Nor does he understand that light is sweet: it is good for our eyes to see Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0051",
      "source_sha256": "31698fb7333ea137",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "And again, there is an advantage for those who see the sun, who is himself Jesus, the sun of righteousness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0052",
      "source_sha256": "43786f362022cde2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "For if there were no heavenly desire greater than every desire in the world, perhaps some fool would say that those who do the works of the flesh are not impoverished."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0053",
      "source_sha256": "e41ee9fd0e8fc5ad",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "Listen and see what the one whose hope is in the Lord said."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0054",
      "source_sha256": "40d8add1e8f3cb56",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "What? So that you do not abandon the will of Jesus, your Lord and your God, because of the will of human beings."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0055",
      "source_sha256": "2c7c7d2471ef5a45",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "And so that you do not abandon purity or virginity because of a desire for marriage, when you do not know whether you will be satisfied with it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0056",
      "source_sha256": "f6912e201c02e88f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "And so that you leave behind the desire for spiritual works because of the bodily works that abound."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0057",
      "source_sha256": "8c57f29aaa793bf4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "He therefore said, “My soul refused to be comforted.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0058",
      "source_sha256": "fbcda8509c331166",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "“I remembered God and rejoiced.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0059",
      "source_sha256": "3adfcf4a07c49735",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "You, however, rejoice over deeds that should cause you grief when you do them, and you take comfort in the company of people who oppose God and his laws."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0060",
      "source_sha256": "2b0e944e476f2269",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "But we read: “I did not sit in their assembly while they were laughing.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0061",
      "source_sha256": "31a99ca22fffd555",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "And: “I did not sit with a worthless assembly.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0062",
      "source_sha256": "3ea52e8e67cb81a7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "“I hated the gathering of those who are wicked, and I will not sit with the ungodly.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0063",
      "source_sha256": "7005d91eceb469aa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "We too sit down with them, and we love them and are their friends."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0064",
      "source_sha256": "180f717870670d8c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "Here is a comfort that is truly empty!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0065",
      "source_sha256": "aaacd7b120152734",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "Here is a friendship that makes a person an enemy of Jesus: our wanting to be comforted by pagans."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0066",
      "source_sha256": "2464e9cff647fc53",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "If we are going to make friends for ourselves, let us make them from among God's people, and let us comfort one another with the comfort of which the saints spoke:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0067",
      "source_sha256": "9ccb0017129c575c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "“So that we may comfort one another through the faith we share, both ours and theirs.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0068",
      "source_sha256": "99e853d7388e776f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "Will the fainthearted among us not say, “How many words there have been from yesterday until today!”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0069",
      "source_sha256": "47f4718fa9364cfa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "Or, “How long will he stay?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0070",
      "source_sha256": "a8b5818c0e233e73",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "Why have we not said instead, “We have lingered in our injustices, our defilements, and all our sins”?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0071",
      "source_sha256": "526c06ce18f34262",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "And, “All that filth piled upon us has scarcely come off at all after all these words, which are like abundant water meant to wash it away and remove it from among us.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0072",
      "source_sha256": "4ea31c66dc103210",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "Then let us too say, “My soul will boast in the Lord.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0073",
      "source_sha256": "1ab589adcfd686e6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "“Let the humble hear and rejoice.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0074",
      "source_sha256": "0acc7aa805d82683",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "“Exalt the Lord with me, and exalt his name together.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0075",
      "source_sha256": "ee4b26360e57c0bc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 19,
      "text": "“Look, I will sing and rise.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0076",
      "source_sha256": "d98361534715f0ac",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "I therefore beg anyone who has not [?] sinned to continue guarding himself."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0077.s1",
      "source_sha256": "55599a054f1edbfc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-15",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "And anyone who is also inwardly encouraged to flee from him, as though being set free by these words,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0077.s2",
      "source_sha256": "fb797466e725f785",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-15",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "and anyone who has resolved in his heart not to sin after hearing these words, so as not to let himself go on doing"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0078",
      "source_sha256": "a2ebe7af0d041367",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "And if we all resolve in our hearts not to sin from the day we heard these words, we believe—and we will not doubt—that Jesus will forgive us for everything we have done."
    }
  ]
}
